p as you protect &amp; prosper for the monster girls you rescue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a base and create custom bedrooms for your girls.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off monster raids to protect your house.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060250/extras/27c4e0ef1d769f2b65c1e30a2b7b3eb0.poster.avif?t=1753458406\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060250/extras/27c4e0ef1d769f2b65c1e30a2b7b3eb0.webm?t=1753458406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060250/extras/27c4e0ef1d769f2b65c1e30a2b7b3eb0.mp4?t=1753458406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
